---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Let Us Stop GBV – Women For Women">
	<Navbar />

	<style is:inline>
		.flicker {
		  animation: flicker 1.2s infinite;
		}
		
		@keyframes flicker {
		  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
		  50% { opacity: 0.4; }
		}
		
		body {
		  background-color: #4A148C;
		  color: #fff;
		  font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
		}
		.hero {
		  background: linear-gradient(to right, #6A1B9A, #4A148C);
		  color: white;
		  padding: 80px 20px;
		  text-align: center;
		}
		.hero h1 {
		  font-size: 3rem;
		  font-weight: bold;
		}
		.section-title {
		  color: #F8BBD0;
		  font-weight: bold;
		  margin-top: 40px;
		  text-align: center;
		}
		.card {
		  background-color: #6A1B9A;
		  color: white;
		  border: none;
		}
		.card:hover {
		  transform: scale(1.02);
		  transition: 0.3s ease;
		}
		.action-buttons .btn {
		  min-width: 150px;
		}
		.btn-danger {
		  background-color: #F06292;
		  border: none;
		}
		.btn-outline-danger {
		  border-color: #F06292;
		  color: #F06292;
		}
		.btn-outline-danger:hover {
		  background-color: #F06292;
		  color: white;
		}
		.btn-warning {
		  background-color: #FFB74D;
		  border: none;
		  color: black;
		}
	</style>

	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<header class="hero d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-center text-white position-relative" style="min-height: 60vh; overflow: hidden;">
		<video autoplay muted loop playsinline class="hero-video" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; min-width: 100%; min-height: 100%; z-index: 0; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.4;">
		  <source src="/assets/video/g5.mp4" type="video/mp4">
		  Your browser does not support the video tag.
	   </video> 
	   <div class="hero-content" style="z-index: 2; position: relative;">
		  <h1 class="display-3 fw-bold">Let Us Stop GBV</h1>
		  <p class="lead">Women For Women – United Against Violence</p>
		  <a href="https://www.change.org/p/stop-gbv-in-south-africa" target="_blank" class="btn btn-light btn-lg mt-3">Sign the Petition</a>
		</div>
	  </header>
	
	  <!-- Campaign Content -->
	  <section class="py-5" style="background-color: #4A148C;">
		<div class="container">
		  <h2 class="section-title">Understanding GBV</h2>
		  <p class="text-center px-4">
			Gender-based violence (GBV) is a violation of human rights and a global public health crisis.
			It includes physical, emotional, sexual, and economic abuse. In South Africa and across the continent,
			women and girls face disproportionate risks. This platform stands for awareness, solidarity, and action.
		  </p>
	
		  <h2 class="section-title">Women For Women</h2>
		  <div class="row justify-content-center">
			<div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
			  <div class="card shadow-sm">
				<img src="/assets/images/stories/img1.png" class="card-img-top" alt="Woman 1">
				<div class="card-body">
				  <h5 class="card-title text-white">Thandiwe's Story</h5>
				  <p class="card-text text-white">“I found strength in sisterhood. We rise together.”</p>
				</div>
			  </div>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
			  <div class="card shadow-sm">
				<img src="/assets/images/stories/ivy.png" class="card-img-top" alt="Woman 2">
				<div class="card-body">
				  <h5 class="card-title text-white">Amina's Voice</h5>
				  <p class="card-text text-white">“Speaking out saved my life. Silence is not safety.”</p>
				</div>
			  </div>
			</div>
		  </div>
	
		  <h2 class="section-title">Take Action</h2>
	
		  <!-- Static Countdown Banner -->
	<h2 class="section-title">Upcoming National Action Days</h2>
	<div class="container mb-5">
	  <div class="p-4 rounded-4 shadow-lg text-center" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);">
		<h5 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color: #F8BBD0;">📅 Mark Your Calendar</h5>
		<p class="mb-2">🟣 <strong>16 Days of Activism:</strong> November 25 – December 10</p>
		<p class="mb-3">🟣 <strong>G20 Shutdown:</strong> November 21</p>
		<div class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
		  <a href="https://www.change.org/p/stop-gbv-in-south-africa" target="_blank" class="btn btn-danger">Join the March</a>
		  <a href="/assets/GBV _booklet.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-light">Download Toolkit</a>
		</div>
	  </div>
	</div>
	
	<!-- Myth vs Fact Flip Cards -->
	<h2 class="section-title">Myth vs Fact</h2>
	<div class="container mb-5">
	  <div class="row justify-content-center">
		<!-- Card 1 -->
		<div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
		  <div class="card text-center text-dark" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="toggleCard(this)">
			<div class="card-body bg-light rounded-3">
			  <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Myth</h5>
			  <p class="card-text">GBV only affects women.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="card-body bg-warning rounded-3 d-none">
			  <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Fact</h5>
			  <p class="card-text">GBV affects all genders, but women are disproportionately impacted.</p>
			</div>
		  </div>
		</div>
	
		<!-- Card 2 -->
		<div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
		  <div class="card text-center text-dark" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="toggleCard(this)">
			<div class="card-body bg-light rounded-3">
			  <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Myth</h5>
			  <p class="card-text">GBV is a private issue, not a public concern.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="card-body bg-warning rounded-3 d-none">
			  <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Fact</h5>
			  <p class="card-text">GBV is a human rights violation and a public health crisis.</p>
			</div>
		  </div>
		</div>
	
		<!-- Card 3 -->
		<div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
		  <div class="card text-center text-dark" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="toggleCard(this)">
			<div class="card-body bg-light rounded-3">
			  <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Myth</h5>
			  <p class="card-text">Only physical violence counts as GBV.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="card-body bg-warning rounded-3 d-none">
			  <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Fact</h5>
			  <p class="card-text">GBV includes emotional, sexual, and economic abuse too.</p>
			</div>
		  </div>
		</div>
	  </div>
	</div>
	
		  <h2 class="section-title">MGCE Solidarity Message</h2>
	
		  <!-- Language Toggle Buttons -->
		  <div class="text-center mb-4">
			<button class="btn btn-outline-light me-2" onclick="showMessage('english')">English</button>
			<button class="btn btn-outline-light me-2" onclick="showMessage('kiswahili')">Kiswahili</button>
			<button class="btn btn-outline-light" onclick="showMessage('zulu')">IsiZulu</button>
		  </div>
	
		  <!-- Glassmorphic Message Container -->
		  <div class="container my-4">
			<div class="p-4 rounded-4 shadow-lg" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);">
			  <div id="message-english">
				<h5 class="text-center fw-bold mb-3" style="color: #F8BBD0;">✊ United Voices Against GBV</h5>
				<p class="fst-italic">
				  “From Maseno to Mzansi, our voices rise as one. We stand with every girl, every woman, every survivor. Gender-based violence is not a South African issue — it’s a global injustice. At MGCE, we believe in power through unity, healing through sisterhood, and justice through action. Together, we say: Enough is enough.”
				</p>
			  </div>
			  <div id="message-kiswahili" style="display: none;">
				<h5 class="text-center fw-bold mb-3" style="color: #F8BBD0;">✊ Sauti Zetu Dhidi ya Ukatili</h5>
				<p class="fst-italic">
				  “Kutoka Maseno hadi Afrika Kusini, sauti zetu zinaungana. Tunasimama na kila msichana, kila mwanamke, kila ocali. Ukatili wa kijinsia si tatizo la taifa moja — ni dhuluma ya kimataifa. MGCE tunaamini katika nguvu ya umoja, uponyaji kupitia undugu wa kike, na haki kupitia vitendo. Tunasema: Imewatosha.”
				</p>
			  </div>
			  <div id="message-zulu" style="display: none;">
				<h5 class="text-center fw-bold mb-3" style="color: #F8BBD0;">✊ Amazwi Obumbano</h5>
				<p class="fst-italic">
				  “Sivela eMaseno siya eMzansi, amazwi ethu ayahlangana. Simi nabo bonke abesifazane, bonke abasindile. Udlame olubhekiswe ebantwini besifazane akulona udaba lwaseNingizimu Afrika kuphela — luyinkinga yomhlaba wonke. Kwa-MGCE, sikholwa emandleni obumbano, ekuphulukeni ngobudlelwano, nasekutholeni ubulungiswa. Sithi: Sekwanele.”
				</p>
			  </div>
			</div>
		  </div>
	
		  <!-- Action Buttons -->
		  <div class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-3 mb-4 action-buttons flex-wrap">
			<a href="https://www.change.org/p/stop-gbv-in-south-africa" target="_blank" class="btn btn-danger">Sign Petition</a>
			<a href="/contact" class="btn btn-pink">Partner With Us</a>
		  </div>
		</div>
	  </section>

	<Footer />

	<script is:inline>
		function showMessage(lang) {
			document.getElementById('message-english').style.display = lang === 'english' ? 'block' : 'none';
			document.getElementById('message-kiswahili').style.display = lang === 'kiswahili' ? 'block' : 'none';
			document.getElementById('message-zulu').style.display = lang === 'zulu' ? 'block' : 'none';
		}
		
		function toggleCard(card) {
			const bodies = card.querySelectorAll('.card-body');
			bodies.forEach(body => body.classList.toggle('d-none'));
		}
	</script>

</Layout>
